'''Mossy''' was an individual active during the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Imperial Era|reign]].<ref name="Aldhani" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|104}}</ref> the rebel [[Karis Nemik]] was found [[Sleep|asleep]] on watch by his colleague [[Arvel Skeen]] while the pair were on the [[planet]] [[Aldhani]] as part of an [[Aldhani rebel infiltration team|infiltration team]]. Skeen woke Nemik and warned him that, if he had been caught asleep at his post while working with Mossy, [[Garvish]], or<ref name="Aldhani" /> the leader of the [[Partisans]],<ref name="ROUVG">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref> [[Saw Gerrera]], his head would have been put on a pike for a laugh.<ref name="Aldhani" />

==Behind the scenes==
Mossy was mentioned in "[[Aldhani (episode)|Aldhani]]," the fourth episode of the [[Andor Season 1|first season]] of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="Aldhani" /> which was aired on [[September 28]], [[2022]].<ref name="Release dates">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1557442379975573504|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-08-10|quote=This is what revolution looks like. Watch #Andor, a Star Wars Original Series, streaming only on @DisneyPlus September 21.|archivedate=20220810191942}}</ref>

